			<div class="content" id="post-content-4855951">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes.</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> since when did the GOC get space cannons and what do you mean by an alien ship falling from the sky.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> SCP-XXXX is an alien ship that was shot down by the GOC and crashed 20 miles west of San Francisco, pieces of the SCP-XXXX was too badly damaged to know the original shape or size of it.</p>
<p>The name Galactic.Co also appears on multiple occasions on walls and windows, the majority of the SCP-XXXX is a core fueled by large glass containers with a very small amount of SCP-XXXX-2, known as gravitonium.</p>
<p>SCP-XXXX-1 is the Survivors of the incident and appears to be a combination of a human and a orca, they are strong, intelligent and can swim very fast, they were discovered in Hawaii existing their escape pods with a few of them injured, because of the GOC they are stuck here with no way for them to contact their home world.</p>
<p>They claimed that they’re from the other side of the galaxy testing some new form of hyper drive from Galactic.Co, the only problem is that it needs larger amounts of SCP-XXXX-2, they thought that there’s enough to go here and back but when they got here, the glass container was almost completely empty.</p>
<p>As for project space cannon, the GOC was building it after the interaction with SCP-2845, knowing that SCP-2845 came from space they decided that earth needed a defense against all extraterrestrial anomalies and entities.</p>
<p>They started the project 7 months later after the foundation contained SCP-2845 and finished it 4 years later with the help of Anderson’s Robotics.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> the hook here is about how the foundation is supposed to take control of the space cannon program from the GOC and the problem with fragments of the ship being used by civilians and groups of interest, like Anderson’s Robotics experimenting with SCP-XXXX-2 or the chaos Insurgency using it as a powerful weapon/bomb.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> this SCP idea is split up in 2 forms, 1 being about the SCP itself and 1 about Project Space Cannon and why the GOC built it, there is also going to be a series of events that took place in the ship before its doom, the trouble of keeping this from the public and a series of test involving SCP-XXXX-2.</p>

